      "review_summary": "This PR adds a `bird whoami` fallback to `import hydrate-profiles` that updates `acct_primary` and `profile_me` in local mode, parses display names, clears stale identity fields, and adds focused tests.\n\nReproducibility: yes. at source level: current main returns with `hydratedAccount: false` whenever the transport is not `xurl`, so bird-authenticated local mode cannot correct the seeded account. I did not execute a live bird setup in this read-only review.",
